From e03349e9cf29869eaeba840925e1bff4ca24d455 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin Malek <kevin@you.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Mar 2026 12:03:44 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Added support for 2 of You.com's tools. Web search,
 giving an agent the ability to fetch the latest news and Web contents, giving
 an agent the ability to fetch a web page in either markdown or html form
 quickly

